t id="textSelect"><option value="normal">Normal</option><option value="large">Large</option></select></div><div class="row"><div class="copy"><b>Reduce motion</b><small>Keep only essential functional motion</small></div><label class="switch"><input id="motionToggle" type="checkbox"><span></span></label></div><div class="row"><div class="copy"><b>High contrast</b><small>Stronger borders and secondary text</small></div><label class="switch"><input id="contrastToggle" type="checkbox"><span></span></label></div></section>
<section class="card"><h3>Startup & performance</h3><p>Choose what opens first and how aggressively unused tools are unloaded.</p><div class="row"><div class="copy"><b>Open on startup</b><small>Last used tool or a fixed tool</small></div><select id="startupSelect"><option value="last">Last used tool</option><option value="focus">Focus</option><option value="expense">Money</option><option value="trading">Trades</option><option value="notes">Notes</option><option value="mileage">Mileage</option></select></div><div class="row"><div class="copy"><b>Memory mode</b><small>Fast switching keeps visited tools open; Low memory safely suspends older tools after save acknowledgement.</small></div><select id="memorySelect"><option value="keep">Fast switching</option><option value="low">Low memory</option></select></div></section>
<section class="card" id="securityCard"><h3>Privacy & security</h3><p>One workspace PIN protects the combined app. Tool-specific legacy PINs are ignored while embedded.</p><div class="row"><div class="copy"><b>Workspace PIN</b><small id="privacyStatus">Off</small></div><button class="action" id="pinEdit" type="button">Set 6-digit PIN</button></div><div class="row"><div class="copy"><b>Lock automatically</b><small>While this page remains open</small></div><select id="lockTimeout"><option value="0">When reopened</option><option value="1">After 1 minute</option><option value="5">After 5 minutes</option><option value="15">After 15 minutes</option></select></div><div class="actions"><button class="action primary" id="lockNow" type="button">Lock now</button><button class="action danger" id="removePin" type="button">Remove PIN</button></div></section>
<section class="card"><h3>Workspace backup & recovery</h3><p>Download or restore structured records plus supported attachment databases. The workspace PIN is intentionally not included.</p><div class="actions"><button class="action primary" id="exportWorkspace" type="button">Download complete backup</button><button class="action" id="restoreWorkspace" type="button">Restore complete backup</button></div><div class="status" id="backupStatus">No workspace backup created in this session.</div></section>
<section class="card"><h3>Versioned data safety</h3><p>Managed records are mirrored into IndexedDB. Previous versions are retained before changes, and safety snapshots can restore the complete structured workspace.</p><div class="status" id="durableStatus">Checking recovery store…</div><div class="actions"><button class="action" id="verifyMirror" type="button">Verify recovery</button><button class="action" id="snapshotBtn" type="button">Create safety snapshot</button><button class="action" id="restoreSnapshotBtn" type="button">Restore latest snapshot</button></div></section>
<section class="card"><h3>App health check</h3><p>Checks shell structure, local save lifecycle, IndexedDB recovery, record schemas, routing contracts, runtime errors and each tool’s live controls.</p><button class="action primary" id="runHealth" type="button">Run full app health check</button><div class="status" id="healthSummary" aria-live="polite">Not checked yet.</div><div class="healthlist" id="healthList"></div></section>
<section class="card"><h3>About this build</h3><p><b>My Life Manager v9.3.0 — Trading Execution.</b> Unified architecture plus mobile-first Trading execution, corrected risk/statistics, screenshot management, bounded Trading recovery, compact history, centered navigation, Fuel Records improvements, and Notes performance fixes.</p></section></div></section></div>
<div class="overlay" id="pinOverlay" hidden><section class="panel small" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="pinTitle"><div class="pinbody"><h2 id="pinTitle">Set workspace PIN</h2><p>Use one 6-digit PIN for the complete workspace.</p><div id="currentPinWrap" hidden><label for="currentPin">Current PIN</label><input class="pinfield" id="currentPin" type="password" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="6" autocomplete="current-password"></div><label for="newPin">New 6-digit PIN</label><input class="pinfield" id="newPin" type="password" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="6" autocomplete="new-password"><label for="confirmPin">Confirm new PIN</label><input class="pinfield" id="confirmPin" type="password" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="6" autocomplete="new-password"><div class="pinerror" id="pinError" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="actions"><button class="action" id="pinCancel" type="button">Cancel</button><button class="action primary" id="pinSave" type="button">Save PIN</button></div></div></section></div>
<div class="overlay" id="lockOverlay" hidden><section class="panel small" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="lockTitle"><div class="pinbody center"><div class="lockmark">🔐</div><h2 id="lockTitle">My Life Manager is locked</h2><p>Enter your workspace PIN to open all five tools.</p><input class="pinfield" id="unlockPin" type="password" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="6" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="••••••"><div class="pinerror" id="unlockError" aria-live="polite"></div><button class="action primary" id="unlockBtn" type="button" style="width:100%">Unlock</button><button class="action" id="forgotBtn" type="button" style="width:100%;margin-top:8px">Forgot PIN?</button><div class="status" id="forgotHelp" hidden>Resetting the privacy screen does not delete your records. Type RESET below, then reset the privacy screen.<input class="pinfield" id="resetWord" maxlength="5" autocomplete="off" style="margin-top:9px" placeholder="RESET"><button class="action danger" id="resetPrivacy" type="button" style="width:100%;margin-top:8px">Reset privacy screen</button></div></div></section></div>
<div class="overlay" id="confirmOverlay" hidden><section class="panel small" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="confirmTitle"><div class="pinbody"><h2 id="confirmTitle">Confirm</h2><p class="confirm-message" id="confirmMessage"></p><div class="actions"><button class="action" id="confirmNo" type="button">Cancel</button><button class="action primary" id="confirmYes" type="button">Continue</button></div></div></section></div>
